{{Information
|description={{en|1=VisualFileChange supports multiple RegEx-replace and offers you methods to preserve certain areas. In addition, you can preview the changes before they are made.
The cursor points on a green button. Clicking this button will turn the contents of the texarea into a valid regular expression that matches all occurrences of the pattern (cheremoya).
The textarea is highlighted in red because the checkbox indicates it is a regular expression while the content of the area are not a valid regular expression.}}
